---
import BaseLayout from '../components/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms | Access Free Tools"
  description="Read the Access Free Tools terms for using free calculators and browser utilities, including accuracy notes and everyday-use limits."
  path="/terms/"
>
  <section class="page-intro">
    <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / Terms</p>
    <h1>Terms</h1>
    <p>Use Access Free Tools responsibly and verify important results before relying on them.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section content-section-narrow legal-copy">
    <h2>General use</h2>
    <p>
      The utilities on this site are provided for general informational and everyday use. They are
      not professional financial, medical, legal, or engineering advice.
    </p>

    <h2>Accuracy</h2>
    <p>
      We aim to make tools accurate and useful, but you should double-check important calculations
      before making decisions.
    </p>

    <h2>Random tools</h2>
    <p>
      Random number tools are provided for ordinary everyday use, examples, and simple choices.
      They should not be used for passwords, gambling, legal drawings, security decisions, or any
      high-stakes process that requires audited randomness.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
